## Scenarios

### semihost SMT JSON loading

#### rejects malformed string ids before integer parsing

- Verify: rejects malformed string ids before integer parsing
   - Expected: smt_json_id_end("x", 0) equals `-1`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 3 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: rejects malformed string ids before integer parsing")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
expect(smt_json_id_end("x", 0)).to_equal(-1)
```

</details>

#### returns the end offset for numeric string ids

- Verify: returns the end offset for numeric string ids
   - Expected: smt_json_id_end("123,", 0) equals `3`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 3 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: returns the end offset for numeric string ids")
expect(smt_json_id_end("123,", 0)).to_equal(3)
```

</details>

